{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a52377bf6a0d7bdbb9f8787bbea417733a8d585cae50c4cb934614bacd5f1be6", "ja": "オリジナルのカクテル作りに挑戦する\n『Sherry 'n Cherry』。\n何度目かの試飲の末、ふたりの個性を\n活かした、最高のカクテルが完成。\nふたりは乾杯するのだった。", "zh": "挑战制作原创鸡尾酒的\n《Sherry 'n Cherry》。\n经过数次试饮，充分发挥两人的个性，\n终于完成了最棒的鸡尾酒。\n两人举杯庆祝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1000_046rio", "source_sha256": "6ed40880870afa7cf27d445eff5f48b5e9531b7655a1347292de071850af3685", "ja": "お待たせ、このみ姉さん。\nこれで宣伝用の写真撮影は終わりっと。次は……。", "zh": "久等了，木实姐。这样宣传用的照片就拍完了。接下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "64034be7f59d449b845745add1565722e6e2ab414e9ecfa0bdc218e05f2a26f7", "ja": "次は、メイキング撮影よ。私達個人のカクテルと\nユニットをイメージしたものを考えるみたい。", "zh": "接下来要拍制作花絮。好像要分别为我们设计个人鸡尾酒，还有以组合为灵感的鸡尾酒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "3c9d3b0469fd1ea26af683b1eeb591baa91ae5adcffe213a0f2fb925d5d44442", "ja": "いつもは飲む側だけど、カクテルを考えるのも\n楽しそうね♪　このみ姉さんは、何か考えてきた？", "zh": "平时都是喝鸡尾酒的一方，不过自己设计鸡尾酒好像也很有意思呢♪ 这个美姐姐，你想好什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "cdfacf07054eebb36a33c4334468d93fad7b8d3452e824a0a0d892011147b691", "ja": "もちろん！　でーも……本番まで内緒♪\nだって今教えちゃったら、つまらないでしょ？", "zh": "当然啦！不——过……在正式登场前要保密♪\n毕竟现在就告诉你的话，不就没意思了嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "26fe6708867ecd2da190959271ab8840c902ea3ed3aea54f4812e3c400b941ae", "ja": "えーっ！？　イジワルしないでよ～。\n私のも教えるから～。ね？", "zh": "诶——！？别捉弄我嘛～。\n我也会告诉你的嘛～。好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "151ef1fca874b75ef149ef24facb7188cf745cde0c3f80745b2b2a0b5917b3f2", "ja": "ふふっ、どうしよっかなぁ……あら、撮影の準備が\nできたみたいね！　行きましょ、莉緒ちゃん♪", "zh": "呵呵，要怎么办才好呢……哎呀，拍摄好像准备好了！我们走吧，莉绪♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1006_null", "source_sha256": "2cd3b46b5a30ec9fbcd79ca9d6e8253b032f20d956a3eb6fa142f7a5d1a50a0a", "ja": "メイキング風景撮影中……", "zh": "正在拍摄花絮……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "22533a7c20f1b397fe56493b82c600cc63af599bf7fb7130d4c9a2291e99d2a5", "ja": "ごちそうさま～！\nあれっ？　このみ姉さん、何杯目かわかる？", "zh": "我吃饱啦～！\n咦？这都不知道是第几杯了，你数得出来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "a0a053f7c4ed887734cb8f28332d2d73759b37d35a30c71935722abf07aeeab4", "ja": "えっと。1、2……3杯目ね。\n莉緒ちゃん、ちょっと聞くけど……もう酔ってる？", "zh": "嗯。1、2……第3杯了。  \n莉绪，我问一下……你已经醉了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "1b7ac2d1609deccb1c12ae1d56fde7dcee1b160e693f27494cbc02f54015777f", "ja": "何言ってるのこのみ姉さん～。3杯目よね、3杯目♪\n……でも、このみ姉さんのって、少し辛口なのね？", "zh": "说什么呢，木实姐姐～。是第3杯吧，第3杯♪  \n……不过，木实姐姐你的酒，味道稍微有点辛辣呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "d576a342d43ef7c05482bb2f64788bc216fc8dbaec42c304873fb09b49e39757", "ja": "私好みの味にしたから、そうかも。\nそういう莉緒ちゃんこそ、さっきから甘めじゃない？", "zh": "因为我调成了自己喜欢的味道，所以可能吧。说起来，莉绪你从刚才开始喝的不是偏甜吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "454a6391cb191625bdec00a4ad2cab1f706cb84474fb6801ab9dd4278ea44020", "ja": "当然よ！　だってセクシーといえば、甘い誘惑でしょ♪\nこのみ姉さんも、甘さを足してみたらどう？", "zh": "当然啦！毕竟说到性感，就得是甜美的诱惑嘛♪\n木实姐也试着再加点甜味怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "472d666aa049b3598bd60782598ad606d627ff6deae04b483abdd04c0cc08e92", "ja": "それもいいけど……これは私達のコラボカクテルよ。\n私や莉緒ちゃんらしさが無いとダメじゃないかしら？", "zh": "那样也不错，不过……这是我们俩的联名鸡尾酒呀。要是没有我和莉绪的特色，可不行吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "b3eb0577297788567edbe42a8e31cf203dbc278fa613caebe49390693e6563a2", "ja": "だから私は、この味でいくわ！\n莉緒ちゃんはどうする？　もう少し調整してみる？", "zh": "所以我就选这个味道了！\n莉绪，你打算怎么办？要不要再稍微调整一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "69a2751dfa96ae8baa756a2b944cb3358caafb416eea601f6fa211491053b2f1", "ja": "ううん、私もこれで！　ふふっ。ファンのみんな、\nどんなカクテルになったか、楽しみに待っててね♪", "zh": "不，我也要这个！呵呵。各位粉丝，\n敬请期待它最后会变成什么样的鸡尾酒吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "9b1b19df798b460307e1b596ae8b521ca619f515c45baaf6617c879b95517a6b", "ja": "さて、次はユニットのカクテルね！\nシェリー酒とさくらんぼは要るとして……。", "zh": "那么，接下来是组合的鸡尾酒！\n雪莉酒和樱桃是必不可少的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "6f6067dff27ef9365f8ae1a797005d6b92072348e0cb2b8cf39026e1d8108489", "ja": "ねえ、私達の魅力は、セクシーとアダルティでしょ？\n味とか色とか、どこかにそういう要素がほしいわね。", "zh": "你说，我们的魅力就在于性感和成熟，对吧？\n不管是味道还是颜色，我想都得加入一些这样的元素才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "b14f24c997faee20c095209edfc8f41262c0aed48ac43256347a14d0ebfa9df2", "ja": "確かにそうね。セクシーと、アダルティ……んん？\n莉緒ちゃんが甘めで、私は辛口……それだわっ！", "zh": "确实呢。性感、成熟……嗯嗯？\n莉緒偏甜，我偏辛辣……就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "ddece6548c0da5e4d261666c4c655935287a8e065e6ae1d72578021304e110a0", "ja": "ありがとう莉緒ちゃん！\nなんだかすごいカクテルができ上がるかも、ふふっ♪", "zh": "谢谢你，莉绪！\n感觉好像能调出一杯不得了的鸡尾酒呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "e0a5f3dadab2ae9c7a444b74fff691a0d678d5eae343c364a2e14b11524c5173", "ja": "……美味しい！　甘くてすごく飲みやすいわね！\nそれに、たまに感じる苦味が大人って感じ♪", "zh": "……好喝！既香甜又很容易入口呢！\n而且，偶尔尝到的苦味也很有成熟的感觉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d93b9c8b72a34ff1dd11f729560ff69c5163f70a58dbd19a9b8e763c2a2eb3f", "ja": "でしょ～！　大人のほろ苦さとスイートな色気で\n私達のユニットを表現してみたの！", "zh": "对吧～！我试着用成年人的微苦和甜美的魅力，来表现我们的组合！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "e64c6778da8b9e482c3b225a8b4f3fd859b5dcddbb9d7f89e7826bd7e9c3d8f8", "ja": "ありがとう。莉緒ちゃんの言葉がなかったら、\nこんな素敵なカクテルにならなかったかも。", "zh": "谢谢。要不是莉绪的建议，说不定就调不出这么棒的鸡尾酒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "ecefc7c2b5874a2853a39de94bfadd1ee3cdc7a11acf953861cc390fc498aafa", "ja": "このみ……姉さん！　なんでそんなに優しいの～。\n私なんて、最後にチェリーを乗せただけなのに……。", "zh": "好美……姐姐！为什么你这么温柔啊～  \n明明我只是最后放上了樱桃而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "8e2a5ab60d5f85d955ca9ab5a8223607470e4f3b21fb925cd8b9693c763a96c6", "ja": "……さっきより酔いが回ってる。\nこれは、早めに切り上げた方がよさそうね。", "zh": "……比刚才醉得更厉害了。\n看来还是早点收场比较好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "e5a0c3f791995a26cebd2c249c5230f6e818a886f190067b09604c323729bf19", "ja": "最後の大役は、莉緒ちゃんにしかできなかったわ。\nこのカクテルは、私達ふたりで作り上げたのよ。", "zh": "最后那个重要的角色，只有莉緒才能胜任。\n这杯鸡尾酒，是我们两个人共同调制出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "59c9adda450945d383fffaf0dc385faf22ec0adb8ee146a1b29c9e95c35da401", "ja": "も、もう！　そんなこと言うなんてズルい……。\nもっと飲みたくなってきちゃった！　おかわりー！", "zh": "真、真是的！说这种话也太犯规了……\n搞得我都想多喝一点了！再来一杯——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "e0c02d119e624f02b22a9313696346e84a483b0ba71acc608f4cf5be446c8e5e", "ja": "ふふっ。莉緒ちゃんも気に入ってくれたみたい。\nそれじゃ、私も。おかわりもらおうかしら♪", "zh": "呵呵。看来莉绪也很喜欢呢。\n那么，我也来一杯吧。能再给我添一杯吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "offer_018_sc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "offer_018_sc_01_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "3a997759dd2edafd7b977b920b43ae0048e3389f59cebd89e04ee90570a7a152", "ja": "それなら、乾杯しましょ！　私達のカクテルで、\nもっとたくさんの人を魅了できるように……。", "zh": "既然这样，那就干杯吧！为了让我们的鸡尾酒能够吸引更多的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
